    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "You make the key decisions",
      "items": [
        "Invoke $project-preflight, then answer questions and confirm choices.",
        "Codex uses the bundled Stage Skills. Missing evidence keeps the current Stage active."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Durable state supports resumption",
      "items": [
        ".project/preflight.md stores the Stage, Gates, evidence, and artifact pointers.",
        "Artifacts can use different carriers; small projects may justify not needing a separate decision map."
      ]
    },
